          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "OpenAI adds 'Trusted Contact' safeguard to ChatGPT for users showing signs of self-harm",
            "articleSection": "Policy & Rights",
            "abstract": "OpenAI has introduced a new safety feature called 'Trusted Contact' that allows ChatGPT users to designate a person who can be notified if their conversations suggest possible self-harm risk. The feature is part of OpenAI's broader effort to make its AI systems safer for vulnerable users, particularly as chatbot usage grows among younger demographics. The opt-in system lets users pre-authorise a trusted person to receive alerts without exposing full conversation content.",
            "url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/05/07/openai-introduces-new-trusted-contact-safeguard-for-cases-of-possible-self-harm/",
            "publisher": {
              "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
